From: RSC-RJCgit <142757046+RSC-RJCgit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 19:51:12 +0930
Subject: [PATCH] Boost: AutomationStates trigger+action, fix
 TriggerProfile/PhoneBattery deserialise, fix jsonassert build conflict

- Add TriggerAutomationState: trigger that fires when a named state equals a chosen value
- Add ActionSetAutomationState: action that sets a named state to a chosen value
- Register both in instantiate(), dummy-object lists, and Dagger module
- Add getAllStateNames() to AutomationStateInterface / AutomationStateService
- Fix TriggerProfile and TriggerPhoneBattery missing from Trigger.instantiate()
  (saved rules using these triggers were silently broken on reload)
- Exclude org.json:json from jsonassert to fix Android build conflict

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

